{
 "id": "rewrite+spend/summary/cold-no-break/5m",
 "description": "The contrast of the summary case that breaks the cache. The same summary (messages 0 to 2, 10,000 tokens to 500) is made on a request 25 minutes after the last, when nothing is cached. There is no prefix to break, so no break is charged: the 9,500 tokens are writes, +$0.03563, against the call, -$0.01250. Turn 3 replays it as a read, +$0.00285. The total is +$0.02598.",
 "source": "more_examples.md#D4",
